# The engine deployment needs only src/ + api/ + requirements.txt.
#
# pyproject.toml is excluded deliberately: Vercel's Python builder prefers
# it over requirements.txt, and its base dependencies leave out FastAPI
# (which lives in the `api` extra), so the function would import-error at
# runtime. api/index.py puts src/ on sys.path rather than pip-installing
# the package, so the build does not need the pyproject at all.
pyproject.toml

web/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
.venv/
node_modules/
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
Makefile
*.md
